<span id="S1.T1.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Unigram Watermarking <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhao et al. (2024)</a></cite></span>
</span></th>
<td id="S1.T1.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">Statistical</td></tr>
