<span id="S1.T1.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Undetectable Watermark <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib9" title="" class="ltx_ref">Christ et al. (2023)</a></cite></span>
</span></th>
<td id="S1.T1.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">Cryptographic</td></tr>
