<span id="S1.T1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S1.T1.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Token Partitioning <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib8" title="" class="ltx_ref">Kirchenbauer et al. (2023)</a></cite></span>
</span></th>
