</figure>
<div id="S4.p11" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p11.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S4.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ 4 Results and analysis ‣ Vaporizer: Breaking Watermarking Schemes for Large Language Model Outputs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> demonstrates the complete vulnerability of the Publicly Detectable Watermarking scheme to all tested attack methods. Each attack strategy achieved a 100% success rate in removing the watermark, indicating fundamental weaknesses in the cryptographic signature approach employed by this scheme.</p>
</div>
